#: ../UpdateManager/Dialogs.py:350
msgid ""
"Run a partial upgrade, to install as many updates as possible.\n"
"\n"
"    This can be caused by:\n"
"     * A previous upgrade which didn't complete\n"
"     * Problems with some of the installed software\n"
"     * Unofficial software packages not provided by Ubuntu\n"
"     * Normal changes of a pre-release version of Ubuntu"
msgstr ""
"Fluer un promotion partial, pro installar quam plus de actualisationes "
"possibile.\n"
"\n"
"    Isto poter ser causate per:\n"
"     * Un previe promotion non completate\n"
"     * Problemas con alcun del software installate\n"
"     * Pacchettos software non official non fornite per Ubuntu\n"
"     * Cambiamentos normal de un version de Ubuntu de pre-edition"

